  ],
  "status": 200,
  "text": "<div><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><img height=\"588\" src=\"https://d502jbuhuh9wk.cloudfront.net/articles/695fbd9ae1ee1c7661cbb924/image-20260108195225-1.png\" width=\"784\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><img height=\"517\" src=\"https://d502jbuhuh9wk.cloudfront.net/articles/695fbd9ae1ee1c7661cbb924/image-20260108195225-2.jpeg\" width=\"689\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Problem Restatement</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">You are given a string s of lowercase English letters.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">The length of s is a <b>perfect square</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Let n = √len(s)</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Fill an n × n grid <b>row-wise</b> (left to right, top to bottom)</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Count:</span></span></span></span>\n\t<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\n\t\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Rows where <b>all characters are the same</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Columns where <b>all characters are the same</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Return the <b>total count</b> (rows + columns)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Approach</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 1: Compute grid size</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">n = int(sqrt(len(s)))</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 2: Build the grid</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Fill the grid row by row:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">grid[i][j] = s[i*n + j]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 3: Count uniform rows</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A row is valid if:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">row[0] == row[1] == ... == row[n-1]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 4: Count uniform columns</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A column is valid if:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">grid[0][j] == grid[1][j] == ... == grid[n-1][j]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Python Implementation</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">import math</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">def count_uniform_rows_and_columns(s):</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    n = int(math.sqrt(len(s)))</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    </span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    # Build the grid</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    grid = []</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    idx = 0</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    for i in range(n):</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">        grid.append(s[idx:idx+n])</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">        idx += n</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    count = 0</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    # Count uniform rows</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    for row in grid:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">        if all(ch == row[0] for ch in row):</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">            count += 1</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    # Count uniform columns</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    for col in range(n):</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">        first_char = grid[0][col]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">        if all(grid[row][col] == first_char for row in range(n)):</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">            count += 1</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    return count</span></span></span></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Given</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>S = \"aaaabbbcc\"</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 1: Grid size</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Length of S = 9<br>\nSince <m:omath><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\"><m:r>9=</m:r></span></i><m:ssup><m:ssuppr><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\"><m:ctrlpr></m:ctrlpr></span></m:ssuppr><m:e><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\"><m:r>3</m:r></span></i></m:e><m:sup><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\"><m:r>2</m:r></span></i></m:sup></m:ssup></m:omath></span></span></span><img height=\"24\" src=\"https://d502jbuhuh9wk.cloudfront.net/articles/695fbd9ae1ee1c7661cbb924/image-20260108195225-3.png\" width=\"53\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">,<br>\n<b>n = 3</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 2: Build the 3 × 3 grid (row-major order)</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">a a a</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">a b b</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">b c c</span></span></span></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 3: Check uniform rows</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A row is counted if all characters are the same.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<table class=\"Table\" style=\"border:undefined\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Row</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Characters</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Uniform?</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">1</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">a a a</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Yes</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">2</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">a b b</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">No</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">3</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">b c c</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">No</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Uniform rows = 1</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">\n<hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Step 4: Check uniform columns</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<table class=\"Table\" style=\"border:undefined\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Column</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Characters</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Uniform?</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">1</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"ma